{"Name":"Tanjong Rhu Road GLS","ShortName":"Tanjong Rhu Road GLS","Description":"Tanjong Rhu Road GLS will bring about 525 homes on a 132,396 sqft site, the first GLS in the area since 1997. A mandatory childcare centre will be included, supporting the government\u0027s vision of Tanjong Rhu as a family-friendly precinct. With strong MRT connectivity, recreational amenities and city-centre proximity, alongside the area\u0027s transformation with over 5,000 new homes. ","StartUrl":"/","Display":"standalone","BackgroundColor":"#ffffff","ThemeColor":"#041e42","Orientation":"portrait","Icons":[{"Src":"https://rtdbookappointment.s3.ap-southeast-1.amazonaws.com/Bookappointment/Property/111be137-5d85-42a0-ad7b-f0898b993638","Sizes":"192x192","Type":"image/png"},{"Src":"https://rtdbookappointment.s3.ap-southeast-1.amazonaws.com/Bookappointment/Property/111be137-5d85-42a0-ad7b-f0898b993638","Sizes":"512x512","Type":"image/png"}]}